{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/37ef96ef6e50608afdb08fa69872413d.poster.avif?t=1756494139\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/37ef96ef6e50608afdb08fa69872413d.webm?t=1756494139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/37ef96ef6e50608afdb08fa69872413d.mp4?t=1756494139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense PvE Battles &amp; Tournaments</strong><br>Jump into high-speed battles, take down legendary opponents, and win exclusive rewards. Compete in tournaments\u2014or host your own right in your shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/4f69d5b7903402b988bab6681a0d2cbf.poster.avif?t=1756494139\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/4f69d5b7903402b988bab6681a0d2cbf.webm?t=1756494139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/4f69d5b7903402b988bab6681a0d2cbf.mp4?t=1756494139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Epic Spin Blades</strong><br>Mix and match rare parts to forge powerful, custom Spin Blades built for your strategy. No two builds are the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/